371 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Get ready to savor the finest beer collection that oh\055so\055perfectly fits your taste buds\041 From the zesty Blonde to the bold and robust Dark\054 we\047ve got you covered\056 Can\047t decide what to choose\077 Our Amber and IPA varieties are sure to tickle your fancy with their unique blends\056 \nBrowse our selection and discover your new favorite brew today\041)
