373 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At David Craft Beer\054 we are driven by a passion for brewing exceptional beer\056 Our commitment to quality and innovation shines through in every pint\056 From our humble beginnings as a group of beer enthusiasts\054 we set out to create unique and unforgettable flavors\056 With meticulous attention to detail and a dedication to pushing the boundaries of brewing\054 we craft beers that captivate the senses and bring people together\056 \nJoin us in experiencing the artistry behind every sip of David Craft Beer\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 374 0 R
     /Pg 360 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
